# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Docker Build Context Exclusions
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# These files/dirs are NEVER sent to the Docker daemon.
# The Dockerfile builds everything from source inside the container.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Node Modules (Docker installs its own via pnpm install) ──
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ── Build Artifacts (Docker builds from source) ──
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Environment & Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Git ──
.git
.gitignore

# ── IDE ──
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# ── OS ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Logs ──
*.log
logs/

# ── Test Files (not needed in production image) ──
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# ── Documentation ──
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ── Examples & Benchmarks (not needed in image) ──
examples/
scripts/benchmarks/causeme/
scripts/benchmarks/longmemeval/cache/
scripts/benchmarks/longmemeval/data/

# ── Infrastructure (CDK, Terraform, etc.) ──
infrastructure/
supabase/

# ── Website (separate deployment) ──
website/

# ── CI/CD (not needed inside containers) ──
.github

# ── Grafana (local monitoring only) ──
grafana/

# ── Claude/AI config ──
.claude/

# ── Audit/debug scripts (not needed in prod images) ──
AGENT-*.md
scripts/db-*.ts
scripts/uc-*.ts
scripts/query-*.ts
scripts/clear-*.ts
scripts/check-*.ts

# ── Docker files themselves ──
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
.dockerignore
